    "text": "myupnow.com\nwebsite\nMarquette\nCandidates for Marquette City Commission, BLP must submit forms soon\nBy Alexandria Bournonville,\n12 hours agoMARQUETTE, Mich. (WBUP/WJMN) — The deadline to file candidacy for the Marquette City Commission and Board of Light and Power (MBLP) is approaching the end of July. This November, voters will elect one member to the Marquette Board of Light and Power (MBLP) and two commissioners for the city commission. Interested parties must file their nomination packets by Tuesday, July 22 at 4 p.m.",
